# Caching on Cloudflare (D-036). Static assets are already served "cache, but revalidate
# every time" (max-age=0, must-revalidate, with an ETag), which is right for the page. The
# build files carry a content hash in their names, so they can be cached for good.
/timber-ui-*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/style-*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Clickjacking and sniffing protection (D-041). The main CSP is a <meta> in the page
# (crates/timber-csp); frame-ancestors only works as a header.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer

